    {
      "id": "where-i-am-how",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "How to read this",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 340
      },
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 360,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Where am I?\n\n**183 graphs** across your library and canon: 76 task graphs, 17 plans, 36 ideas, 40 smoke tests, demos and Q&A. It was written from the graphs themselves (a task graph's goal status and task counts, and when the file last changed in git) on 2026-10-25, so it can be run again.\n\n**The sort.** *Now* = changed since 2026-10-19. *Started, then quiet* = some tasks done or in progress, nothing touched since. *Not started* = every task still to do. *Finished* = the goal is done. *Cancelled* = the goal is cancelled. \"yours\" is your personal library; \"canon\" is the Twilite Zone repository.\n\n**One fact about the dates.** Almost everything older than 2026-10-19 was last changed on 15 October, in one burst: the Methods, events, Bridges and workspace work. So \"quiet\" mostly means \"since that burst\", not \"abandoned\"."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "where-i-am"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "where-i-am-now",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Now",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 740
      },
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 530,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Now (7)\n\nWhat has moved since 2026-10-19.\n\n- **Authoring switches** (yours plans/authoring-switches, 2026-10-25)\n- **Primitives, self-documenting** (yours tasks/primitives-self-documenting, 2026-10-24) — in-progress: 2 done, 1 waiting, 6 todo, 1 cancelled, 2 open questions\n- **Expandable Graph Rooms** (yours ideas/expandable-graph-rooms, 2026-10-23)\n- **Graph Standardization** (yours ideas/graph-standardization, 2026-10-23)\n- **Canon templates in order** (yours tasks/canon-templates-in-order, 2026-10-22) — in-progress: 5 done, 7 todo, 2 open questions\n- **A workspace bar that says what it does** (yours plans/workspace-toolbar, 2026-10-20)\n- **Twilite Zone graphs follow the view-shape rule** (yours tasks/canon-view-shape-consistency, 2026-10-20) — in-progress: 1 done, 1 blocked, 3 todo, 1 open question\n\n**Not in this list because they have no root graph of their own:** the handle demos (`plans/handles-demo`), the new primitive drafts (`plans/new-primitives`: environment, ground, event), and the task for the work in front of you, `tasks/properties-and-authoring-contract`."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "where-i-am"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "where-i-am-quiet",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Started, then quiet",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1310
      },
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 1130,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Started, then quiet (29)\n\nSome of the work is done or under way, and nothing has changed since 2026-10-19. These are the ones most likely to be nearly finished, or quietly overtaken by other work.\n\n- **Michael's Task Collection** (yours tasks/root, 2026-10-18): 1 in-progress, 1 waiting, 1 todo\n- **Unify workspace and graph space** (yours tasks/workspace-graph-space-unification, 2026-10-18) — in-progress: 4 done, 3 in-progress\n- **Validate workspace graph saving and connection dragging** (yours tasks/workspace-save-connection-validation, 2026-10-18) — in-progress: 2 in-progress\n- **Assemble the Page as One Stacked View** (yours tasks/page-stacked-view-assembly, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 done, 2 open questions\n- **Beta Readiness** (canon tasks/beta-readiness, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 6 done, 5 in-progress, 2 todo\n- **Build the Front Door From Pieces** (yours tasks/page-front-door-from-pieces, 2026-10-15) — open: 3 done, 1 in-progress, 1 todo, 1 open question\n- **Continuous View Resolution** (canon tasks/continuous-view-resolution, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 4 done, 2 in-progress\n- **Create the Chat Provenance Node** (yours tasks/chat-node-provenance, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 3 done, 3 in-progress, 2 waiting, 2 todo\n- **Declaration Surfaces: Make the Spec True** (canon tasks/declaration-surfaces, 2026-10-15) — open: 6 done, 5 in-progress, 1 todo\n- **Events: Occurrence and Delivery Contract** (yours tasks/events-occurrence-delivery, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 5 done, 3 in-progress, 1 todo\n- **Focus-sized documents in the workspace** (canon tasks/focus-sized-workspace, 2026-10-15) — todo: 2 done, 1 in-progress, 6 todo\n- **Give Bridges Role-Shaped Sections** (yours tasks/bridge-editor-sections, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 4 in-progress, 1 todo, 1 open question\n- **Graph Organization Law** (canon tasks/graph-organization, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 5 done, 1 in-progress\n- **Implement Edge Endpoint Reassignment** (yours tasks/edge-endpoint-reassignment, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 2 in-progress, 5 todo\n- **Implement Graph-Authored Ports and Handles** (yours tasks/ports-and-handles-interface, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 5 done, 2 in-progress, 1 todo\n- **Move Event Subscriptions onto Bridges** (yours tasks/bridge-owned-event-subscriptions, 2026-10-15) — open: 6 done, 3 in-progress\n- **New User Experience** (canon tasks/new-user-experience, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 1 in-progress, 1 open question\n- **Property Nodes and Inline Editing** (yours tasks/property-node-inline-editor, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 3 done, 6 in-progress\n- **Resource Resolution and Web Content** (yours tasks/resource-resolution-and-web-content, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 5 done, 2 in-progress, 1 waiting\n- **Show Events in the Bridge Editor** (yours tasks/bridge-editor-events, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 2 done, 2 in-progress, 1 todo\n- **Template Video and UI Polish** (yours tasks/template-video-ui-polish, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 7 done, 2 in-progress, 1 open question\n- **Workspace Bridge Apertures** (canon tasks/workspace-bridge-apertures, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 3 done, 4 in-progress, 1 todo, 3 open questions\n- **Workspace Graph-Node Projection** (canon tasks/workspace-graph-node-projection, 2026-10-15) — in-progress: 9 in-progress, 3 todo, 1 open question\n- **Zoom Level: Floor From Content, Ceiling From Allotted Space** (yours tasks/zoom-level-floor-ceiling-model, 2026-10-15) — todo: 1 done, 4 todo\n- **Design the Wikipedia Browser Template** (yours tasks/wikipedia-browser-template-design, 2026-10-14) — in-progress: 3 done, 1 in-progress\n- **Revised save workflow** (canon tasks/revised-save-workflow, 2026-10-14): 1 done\n- **semantic-zoom** (canon tasks/semantic-zoom, 2026-08-16): 1 done\n- **edge-classes** (canon tasks/edge-classes, 2026-08-02) — in-progress: 1 done, 4 in-progress, 1 todo, 1 open question\n- **ui-analysis** (canon tasks/ui-analysis, 2026-05-20) — open: 3 done, 14 in-progress, 6 todo, 1 open question"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "where-i-am"
        }
      }
