      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Not started (26)\n\nEvery task still to do.\n\n- **App Settings Panel & Mouse Sensitivity** (canon tasks/app-settings-panel, 2026-10-15) — open: 6 todo, 1 open question\n- **Authoring Contract Hardening** (canon tasks/authoring-contract-hardening, 2026-10-15) — open: 4 todo, 1 open, 2 open questions\n- **Build the Stroke Control Graph** (yours tasks/stroke-control-template, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 1 open question\n- **Carry Class Events Across Bridges** (yours tasks/bridge-class-scoped-events, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 1 open question\n- **Give Every Method Call an Identity** (yours tasks/method-invocation-identity, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 2 open questions\n- **Graph-Scoped Skills** (yours tasks/graph-scoped-skills, 2026-10-15) — todo: 9 todo, 3 open questions\n- **Methods: Invocation Contract and First Runtime Slice** (yours tasks/methods-invocation-contract, 2026-10-15) — todo: 9 todo, 3 open questions\n- **Move Failure Policy to the Handler** (yours tasks/handler-method-failure-policy, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 1 open question\n- **Prototype the Question-Driven Explanation Template** (yours tasks/question-driven-explanation-template, 2026-10-15) — todo: 7 todo, 2 open questions\n- **Reuse One Method From Two Handlers** (yours tasks/method-reuse-two-handlers, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 1 open question\n- **Smoke Test Export and Import** (yours tasks/bridge-events-smoke, 2026-10-15) — open: 5 todo, 1 open question\n- **Workspace Topological Adjacency** (yours tasks/workspace-topological-adjacency, 2026-10-15) — proposed: 6 todo, 3 open questions, 1 decision pending\n- **Mouse Controls (Context Menus + Radial Menu)** (canon tasks/mouse-controls, 2026-10-14) — todo: 6 todo, 2 open questions\n- **core-loop-proof** (canon tasks/core-loop-proof, 2026-08-02) — open: 6 todo, 1 open, 2 open questions\n- **intent-first-authoring** (canon tasks/intent-first-authoring, 2026-08-02) — todo: 4 todo\n- **interaction-policy** (canon tasks/interaction-policy, 2026-08-02) — todo: 7 todo, 1 open question\n- **local-node-runtime** (canon tasks/local-node-runtime, 2026-08-02) — open: 6 todo, 1 open, 1 open question\n- **modularization-boundaries.task.node** (canon tasks/modularization-boundaries.task, 2026-08-02) — todo: 2 todo, 1 open question\n- **port-primitives** (canon tasks/port-primitives, 2026-08-02) — todo: 4 todo, 1 open question\n- **template-contract-composition** (canon tasks/template-contract-composition, 2026-08-02) — todo: 4 todo, 1 open question\n- **tutorial-howto-cluster** (canon tasks/tutorial-howto-cluster, 2026-08-02) — active: 4 todo, 1 open question\n- **view-data-script-template** (canon tasks/view-data-script-template, 2026-08-02) — todo: 4 todo, 1 open question\n- **vscode-landing-surface** (canon tasks/vscode-landing-surface, 2026-08-02) — todo: 2 todo, 1 open question\n- **bounded-interactive-markdown** (canon tasks/bounded-interactive-markdown, 2026-05-20) — open: 4 todo, 1 open question\n- **diagnostics** (canon tasks/diagnostics, 2026-05-20) — open: 5 todo, 1 open, 1 open question\n- **users** (canon tasks/users, 2026-05-20) — todo: 1 todo, 1 open question"
        },
        "identity": {
