      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Finished (15)\n\nThe goal is marked done. These are candidates for the archive (`tasks/archive`), which would take them off the list without deleting anything.\n\n- **Analytics Implementation Plan** (yours tasks/analytics-implementation-plan, 2026-10-15) — done: 10 done\n- **Enforce Method Effect Declarations** (yours tasks/method-effects-gate, 2026-10-15) — achieved: 5 done, 1 open question\n- **Interaction and Semantic Zoom Roadmap** (yours tasks/interaction-semantic-zoom-roadmap, 2026-10-15) — done: 7 done\n- **Make the Edge Class Consume Stroke Controls** (yours tasks/edge-class-consumes-stroke-control, 2026-10-15) — done: 5 done\n- **Multi-Graph Workspace** (canon tasks/multi-graph-workspace, 2026-10-15) — done: 10 done\n- **Prove Multi-Declaration Expansion** (yours tasks/multi-declaration-expansion, 2026-10-15) — done: 6 done\n- **Task Nodeset Upgrade Plan** (yours tasks/task-nodeset-upgrade-plan, 2026-10-15) — done: 16 done\n- **The Primitive Library: One Graph per Primitive** (canon tasks/primitive-library, 2026-10-15) — done: 17 done\n- **Type and Instance Presentation** (yours tasks/type-and-instance-presentation, 2026-10-14) — done: 5 done\n- **dictionary-demotion** (canon tasks/dictionary-demotion, 2026-08-02) — done: 4 done\n- **nodeset-planning** (canon tasks/nodeset-planning, 2026-08-02) — done: 1 done\n- **performance-audit** (canon tasks/performance-audit, 2026-08-02) — done: 7 done, 1 open question\n- **radial-menu** (canon tasks/radial-menu, 2026-08-02) — done: 3 done\n- **layout-stability** (canon tasks/layout-stability, 2026-07-08) — done: 6 done\n- **content-app-separation** (canon tasks/content-app-separation, 2026-07-06) — done: 4 done"
